<title>UK: BoE says must sell 9.3 bln stg in gilts by March.</title>
<headline>BoE says must sell 9.3 bln stg in gilts by March.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said on Tuesday it had a further 9.3 billion stg of gilts to sell from now until the end of the financial year in March 1997.</p>
<p>Up to the end of November 1996, the Bank said it had sold gilts worth 26.6 billion stg in total. In addition, the Bank sold 2.5 billion stg of gilts due 2002 on December 4.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 5109</p>
